  m_Name: SeaVoidMooring
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BuildingDefinition
  id: SeaVoidMooring
  displayName: Void Mooring
  description: 'Black stone piers into a sea of starlight, and void barges moored
    to pylons of light. Build one in two of your towns on the same water and merchant
    ships sail between them: coin and goods every voyage, more for long routes between
    big towns. Pirates prey on them; lighthouses and warships keep them safer. Each
    upgrade opens one more route.'
